Bind Npc 24202 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14202 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 786 "[Crack of All Means] What's this?"
    Journal for karus "You must perform the mission assigned by [Advisor] Herga."
    Journal for elmorad "You must perform the mission assigned by [Advisor] Nez."
    Collect 1 of 900323000

Requires player level >= 53 and quest 785 is completed

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "So we just have to go find [Secret Agent] Clarence from [Belua Village]. Let's hurry."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "So we just have to go find [Secret Agent] Clarence from [Aska Village]. Let's hurry."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Long time no see, <selfname>. What's going on?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Contaminants Report? Another strange thing carrying nice surprise. What good. That I owe one they do not need you to help me.\n\nDeliver [Contamination Component Report] to [Secret Deputy] Clarence following the order from Herga."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Long time no see, <selfname>. What's going on?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Contaminants Report? Another strange thing carrying nice surprise. What good. That I owe one they do not need you to help me.\n\nDeliver [Contamination Component Report] to [Secret Deputy] Clarence following the order from Nez."

On in_progress
    Say "Where's the report?"

On claimable
    Show quest "What's this?\n\nPlease collect [Shiny Fruit] and [Legendary Shiny Fruit] from the place I send you. You can get them from [Anceitn Trent] and [Legendary Old Tree]."
